# Minimize exports

Export only what another module must call. Keep helpers, indexes, walkers, and intermediate types module-private. Extra exports couple callers to internals and freeze refactors.

```typescript
// ❌
export const lastTokenPluralize = ...
export const isVerbatimMapping = ...
export const settingsForStrategy = ...

// ✅
const lastTokenPluralize = ...
export const createCasing = ...
```

Do not re-export a type that is only the function's parameter. One export per concern; grow a barrel only when a second module needs the name.